{"sourceUrl":"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/chemcn/2026/0808/c34735a3194075/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:14.093924+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/chemcn/2026/0808/c34735a3194075/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>欢迎优秀应届本科生申请浙江大学化学系<span>2027</span>年推免研究生。相关说明如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、招收类型</span></strong></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>学位类型</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业代码</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业名称</span></p></td><td><p><span>拟招推免生类型</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>学术学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>070300</span></p></td><td><p><span>化学</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免直博、推免硕士（仅招国优计划专项）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>085600</span></p></td><td><p><span>材料与化工</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>086000</span></p></td><td><p><span>生物与医药</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong><span>二、关于报名</span></strong></p><p><span>申请浙江大学化学系<span>2027</span>年推免研究生，须在浙江大学推免报名系统中提交申请，<strong><span>申请时间为<span>8</span>月<span>10</span>日<span>-9</span>月<span>8</span>日</span></strong>，报名截止前可在系统中修改报考信息。</span></p><p><span>申请条件、报名方式和报名流程等详见</span><span><span>“<a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28498a3193539/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">浙江大学关于<span>2027</span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知</a>”</span></span><span>。其中，报考直博需满足以下英语成绩要求：大学英语六级<span>460</span>分及以上，或<span>WSK</span>（<span>PETS 5</span>）合格，或英语专业八级合格，成绩有效期为五年，即<span>2022</span>年<span>6</span>月及以后的成绩有效；或雅思<span>5.5</span>分及以上，或托福<span>80</span>分及以上，成绩有效期参照证书的有效期。</span></p><p><span>申请材料：（<span>1</span>）有效身份证扫描件；（<span>2</span>）本科阶段成绩单，加盖教务部门公章；（<span>3</span>）外语水平证明材料；（<span>4</span>）推免直博，还须提供报考学科领域内副高及以上职称专家的</span><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/52686959dcbd6ca4246b.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/f5/b4/e492b27948d5bc7292abbc81f0d5/ade3a1cf-eb94-4d23-877c-3f8edbcb185b.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">推荐信.docx</a></span></span><span><span>2</span>封（专家手写签名或电子签名）；（<span>5</span>）其他重要证明材料（自选上传）。<strong><span>请严格按照上述顺序将材料依次扫描并合并成一个<span>PDF</span>文档在报名系统的“附件材料”中上传。</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span>三、其他</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>请积极联系导师，尽早明确研究兴趣和攻读类型，化学系导师目录详见：</span><a href=\"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/chemcn/axw/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span>点击链接</span></span></span></span></span></a></p><p><span>2.</span><span>博士生导师可同时招收直博生和硕士生，硕士生导师仅可招收硕士生。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>化学系<span>2027</span>级专业学位硕士研究生执行收费标准为<span>4</span>万元<span>/</span>生·全程。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>报名时请慎重填报推免专业和类型，复试时将以浙大推免系统中填报的志愿为准。</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：<span><span>yanjiang@zju.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学化学系</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年<span>8</span>月<span>8</span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"a92913b198f798d2512712dfe5ee235ca805f0093ab4d245edbdd8f39037a247","textLength":725,"sourceSha256":"2e6abd016e4d9c4c1efc4c9da33c86e74c69cc6df7d3a3bb11a2690b66b09d19","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-45ef85da9283d4abeaf8","title":"2026年浙江大学化学系关于2027年接收推荐免试研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:14.093924+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/52686959dcbd6ca4246b.gif"}]}
